{"agent":"lean1-schema-trim","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"The final assertion `assert ADD_TOOLS  # the add tools still carry the answer arguments` does not do what its comment claims. `ADD_TOOLS` is a separate export from `TOOLS` (both are imported), and the only thing asserted is that the collection is non-empty — trivially true as long as the module defines any add tools. Nothing verifies that the add tools actually carry the `as_agent`/`relation`/`check_only` parameters, nor their (short) descriptions.\n\nConcretely: the loop above iterates `TOOLS.items()` and only flags an arg when `arg in props`. If the seven add tools live in `ADD_TOOLS` rather than `TOOLS` (the reason the test imports `ADD_TOOLS` at all), then a regression that restores the full `relation`/`check_only` text on those seven tools — the exact ~5 KB this change targets — is never inspected: the loop skips them, and `assert ADD_TOOLS` still passes. Likewise, if a change drops `as_agent`/`relation`/`check_only` entirely from the add tools, the loop silently skips the missing arg and the assertion still passes, so the \"answer arguments\" are not actually guarded.\n\nTo be effective the check would need to iterate the add tools (e.g. `for name in ADD_TOOLS: props = _schema(TOOLS[name])[\"properties\"]; assert ...`) and assert the args are present, not merely that the container is truthy.","digest":"64087069fed26e7a","location":"tests/test_mcp_tool_budget.py:34-37 (`test_shared_parameter_descriptions_are_not_repeated_in_full` / `assert ADD_TOOLS`)","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_mcp_tool_budget.py:34-37 (`test_shared_parameter_descriptions_are_not_repeated_in_full` / `assert ADD_TOOLS`)"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","diff_chars":6176,"diff_sha":"d0a10152d04f0bdd8524538d4d9b82faad08e79fcb99f4db33229caa120522df","diff_source":"main..HEAD + working tree in /home/delian/src/.ddflow-worktrees/B-mcp-schema-trim","elapsed_s":184.3,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash","reason":"","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewer_digest":"d34b8af1b4a590b5","status":"REVIEWED","titles":["tests/test_mcp_tool_budget.py:34-37 (`test_shared_parameter_descriptions_are_not_repeated_in_full` / `assert ADD_TOOLS`)"],"unreviewed":[]},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"1 finding(s)"},"id":"e2fc041a7397a51db71b26b01","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":9366,"schema":1,"subject":"B-mcp-schema-trim","ts":"2026-10-02T10:40:08.958829Z"}
